15
00:03:19.373 --> 00:03:23.770
Today is the 3rd of December.
the year 1843.

16
00:03:25.988 --> 00:03:31.212
We proceed in the interrogation
of Maiden Mary.

17
00:03:31.254 --> 00:03:36.957
