and Mary a lesson.

49
00:07:44.899 --> 00:07:47.902
Have your brother
come to the farm.

50
00:08:57.972 --> 00:09:00.759
Please. Eustace.

51
00:09:00.801 --> 00:09:03.805
You do realize
you're asking a lot of me?

52
00:09:03.847 --> 00:09:06.197
Eleanor is a fine worker.

53
00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.159
I would not ask you
to take her word

54
00:09:10.201 --> 00:09:14.816
