113
00:14:52.369 --> 00:14:54.503
I can't spend my days
without you.

114
00:14:58.071 --> 00:15:00.118
It's a risk.
We can't be seen together.

115
00:15:02.466 --> 00:15:04.209
Let a few days pass.

116
00:15:08.385 --> 00:15:10.171
But they'll take...

117
00:15:10.213 --> 00:15:11.738
